/ It will make ajax call to create a comment for signed in user
/ For non signed in user, it will keeps form values in session and redirects to log in page
/ So disable set `remote` to false for non-signed-in users to redirect properly
= form_for comment, url: create_comment_path, remote: current_user.present?, data: { html: true } do |f|
  = f.text_area :content_markdown, placeholder: 'Write a comment...'

  .row
    = f.submit 'Post comment'

  .comment-list
    - comments.each do |comment|
      = render partial: 'partials/comment', locals: { comment: comment }